Room for Rent in Riyadh An Nasim Al Gharbi  §15,000/annually375m²a bachelor room for rent in al-naseem al-gharbi district, a room with a bathroom, on osama bin zaid street, close to hijab markets. the annual rent is 17,000 saudi riyals, inclusive of water and electricity, with the option to pay in four installments.
for contact: al-zuman real estate office ((the advertiser's number appears upon contact))
office location: al-naseem al-gharbi district, abdullah bin masoud street, opposite al-dhiyab mosque.An Nasim Al Gharbi, Riyadh
